	"levelNamePattern": "Place_%idx",
	"tutorialDesc": "The story places of Chronos Settlement drawn by hand (sim/storyPlaces.ts): where a trip that comes to one is seen going on the watch screen. Drawn as the dungeon floors are (maps/delve-floors.ldtk): paint the Ground (an empty cell is solid rock; walls are drawn where rock or a wall meets open ground), put a Room at each spot the party makes for, numbered by `step` in order (0 the way in), and dress it with Props. The level’s `dests` (destination ids, or the start of one ending in a colon), `words` (words in the destination’s name) and `kinds` (the kinds of place on the land) say which trips come here. After editing, run `node tools/ldtk-maps.mjs` to make src/shared/data/storyPlaces.ts.",
